Cisco packet tracer 
Cisco Packet Tracer is computer networking simulation software for teaching and learning networking, IoT, and cybersecurity skills in a virtual lab.
NETWORK ESSENTIALS CLASS


IP ADDRESS = WHERE THE DEVICE IS ON THE NETWORK
MAC ADDRESS = WHICH PHYSICAL/NETWORK INTERFACE THE DEVICE IS 

MAC ADDRESS is important because it gives a a device a unique identity a local network.

Why building a MAC ADDRESS is useful
- identifying devices on a network 
- troubleshoot network connections 
- dectect unfamilar devices
- investigate suspicious network activity 
- understand how swiches move network traffic 



